@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Informatii despre API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Toate produsele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Filtrare dupa categorie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=React

### Cautare dupa titlu sau autor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=react

### Sortare dupa pret crescator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=price_asc

### Sortare dupa pret descrescator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=price_desc

### Sortare dupa titlu A-Z
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=title_asc

### Sortare dupa titlu Z-A
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=title_desc

### Cele mai noi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=newest

### Combinare categorie + cautare + sortare
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=React&search=react&sort=price_asc

### Produse recomandate - functionalitate din L2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?featured=true

### Un singur produs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/3

### ID invalid - 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/abc

### Produs inexistent - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999

### Sortare invalida - 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=gresit

### Categorii
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Ruta inexistenta - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nu-exista
